codex
The independent checker reproduced the reported modular counts and found no failures in 396 prime pairs below 300, using its own exact form composition. T3 and T4 hold in that range. P5’s statement can be repaired with a stronger field argument. I also found direct prior art on both discriminant families in Milović’s paper; the claim that T3–T4 are new needs qualification.

